    "bbox": [
      175.77,
      225.55,
      387.92,
      250.89
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE REPEAL OF THE REGIONALINFRASTRUCTURE DEVELOPMENT LEVY ACT, NO. 51 OF 2006",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      261.55,
      401.69,
      286.89
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      297.55,
      401.68,
      322.89
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Regional InfrastructureDevelopment Levy (Repeal) Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      333.55,
      401.77,
      370.89
    ],
    "text": "2.(1) The Regional Infrastructure Development LevyAct, No. 51 of 2006 is hereby deemed to be repealed witheffect from January 1, 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      381.55,
      401.93,
      430.89
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of this Act shall, notwithstanding suchrepeal, in respect of the matters set out in subsection (3), bein operation for a period of one year from the date of thecoming into operation of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      441.55,
      402.09,
      574.89
    ],
    "text": "(3) Notwithstanding the repeal of the RegionalInfrastructure Development Levy Act, No. 51 of 2006 witheffect from January 1, 2011, the Director-General of Customsis hereby empowered to recover all sums due under section2 of the repealed Act, as Regional Infrastructure DevelopmentLevy with effect from January 1, 2011, to the dayimmediately preceding the day on which the period ofoperation of one year specified in subsection (2) expires,and transmit all sums so recovered by him as RegionalInfrastructure Development Levy, to the Consolidated Fundin terms of section 5 of the repealed Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      585.55,
      455.15,
      637.09
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of an inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text to prevail.In case of aninconsistencythe Sinhalatext toprevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
